## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a practical CAPA program around data privacy, tenant isolation, and controlled policy changes in real-time fintech systems.

## Key Concepts
- CAPA data model: evidence, lineage, owners, policy references
- Tenant-aware lifecycle: detect, contain, remediate, verify with SLAs
- Minimal API: create/update CAPAs with logs/traces, policy links
- Metrics: containment time, recurrence rate, tenant impact
- RCA and canary rollback: structured **root cause** templates and safe rollout controls

## Code Example
```javascript
